ommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch-A-Varargs into master","messageBody":"","tags":["v0.2","A-Varargs"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-11T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"7b49d598eb90883824f02867134cf0237e75fdee","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions to document important assumptions","messageBody":"Spoon throws input validation exceptions for user errors,\nbut leaves important assumptions unverified at runtime.\n\nIf such assumptions are not verified, Spoon will crash.\n\nAdd assertions for crucial classes:\n* Parser: Verify non-null input, non-empty word arrays,\n  and non-execution of dead-code branches.\n* TaskList: Verify valid index bounds, non-null task\n  addition and task size decrement after deletion.\n* Storage: Verify non-null file paths and task lists,\n  proper task initialization and non-empty string\n  formatting and display.\n\nThese assertions document important developer asumptions\nthat should always be true and enable the developer to\nensure the validity of these assumptions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":14,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":30,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"050e1b9e59403a3f1f447c14eaa6b07f050a8763","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions to Spoon.java","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"0c109bb10368bdf2d3704425e4f3153e27c98ec4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve code quality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":238,"deletions":145}}},{"hash":"7e20fc09b3013751bac3ac69e137f45d01f547b9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Implement streams for code efficiency and quality","messageBody":"Spoon uses interative for-loops and nested loops\nto manually accumulate tasks to return or display.\n\nStream implementation will improve the code readability\nand reduce the use of convoluted loops in  Spoon.\n\nImplement streams in crucial classes:\n* TaskList: Filter by dates and keyword(s).\n* Storage: Output and formatting of tasks to be saved\n  to an external file.\n* UserInterface: Output of a 1-indexed list with a header.\n\nThese implementations help improve code readabiity and quality\nwhile making Spoon more efficient and less complex.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":29,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"79624e4ffebfd9ba23ec3c560dc85bfdffd723b7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from kong-xin-yang/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"216f7d52863b12e3e2388ac354c195682a5f4ef9","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e0c83a86425ac8c7f46ddba2f5e7d566b588b809","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"934b12c533dd1e491deecefbfdc404c6fd2c91ab","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from kong-xin-yang/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"24a1e3553f256858806e8152b9a1124c246455c7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"481c6d19aaddf7132e8573fc61cd091d7c755aa6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from kong-xin-yang/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-12T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"417903f49341ad692f0e5a887f351fcfae17bf16","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add minor fixes","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":6}}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"kong-xin-yang":{"java":1907,"md":0,"fxml":45,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":23,"txt":0}},"authorContributionVarianc